riables explicitly depend only on earlier tape coordinates. Fresh sample index k is strictly outside that prefix; independence is used at the correct query point.","id":"topic:binding","source":["src_293fe077ed407a88295c42d8","src_c2006baa6ea30939f6b9a763","src_bc5f0f02387e648e447be892","src_769acb1dc63ec3a33d05a54d","src_555842d1134266274751bccc","src_60fadde6ad80613d32896e45","src_dc6478c950ca730ea0987c12","src_d02eadaa16a3572f6afee7f9","src_4fa1940db34571e3a7f7fb2d","src_9cc08ee4796eaf54d485652b","src_4b2b38c364168ed4ffbf2578","src_11df7e512043b7f430109d54","src_6cd6624b5f4f11c2ab76bf05"],"verdict":"match"},{"candidate":["candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.batch_mean_sub/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.batch_noise/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.integral_norm_le_sqrt/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.momentum_noise/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.momentum_sqrt_le/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.noise_cross/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.noise_sq/preferred"],"comparison":"These are supporting implications whose hypotheses are precisely the stated analytic assumptions or recurrences. Their conclusions supply intermediate bounds/correspondences, not assumptions of the final source theorem. The source noise proof uses measurable past-dependent queries, IID fresh samples, unbiasedness and variance<=sigma^2. Batch variance scales as sigma^2/B; momentum variance keeps the first-step coefficient, and the sharper scalar root estimate yields the source beta transient.","id":"topic:logic","source":["src_293fe077ed407a88295c42d8","src_c2006baa6ea30939f6b9a763","src_bc5f0f02387e648e447be892","src_769acb1dc63ec3a33d05a54d","src_555842d1134266274751bccc","src_60fadde6ad80613d32896e45","src_dc6478c950ca730ea0987c12","src_d02eadaa16a3572f6afee7f9","src_4fa1940db34571e3a7f7fb2d","src