red"],"comparison":"The explicit D0 and momentum recursion under B>=1,0<=beta<1 and W_t depending only on the first tB samples give measurability, dependence through (t+1)B, squared-integrability and variance <=sigma^2/B * (a+(1-a)beta^(2t)), a=(1-beta)/(1+beta). The initialization coefficient is retained. For 0<=beta<1 and 0<=y<=1, sqrt(a+(1-a)y^2)<=sqrt(a)+beta*y, a=(1-beta)/(1+beta). This sharpened scalar deduction gives beta^(t+1) rather than beta^t and supports the printed source transient coefficient beta/(1-beta).","id":"topic:expressions","source":["src_293fe077ed407a88295c42d8","src_c2006baa6ea30939f6b9a763","src_bc5f0f02387e648e447be892","src_769acb1dc63ec3a33d05a54d","src_555842d1134266274751bccc","src_60fadde6ad80613d32896e45","src_dc6478c950ca730ea0987c12","src_d02eadaa16a3572f6afee7f9","src_4fa1940db34571e3a7f7fb2d","src_9cc08ee4796eaf54d485652b","src_4b2b38c364168ed4ffbf2578","src_11df7e512043b7f430109d54","src_6cd6624b5f4f11c2ab76bf05"],"verdict":"match"},{"candidate":["candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.batch_mean_sub/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.batch_noise/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.integral_norm_le_sqrt/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.momentum_noise/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.momentum_sqrt_le/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.noise_cross/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.noise_sq/preferred"],"comparison":"Noise is formed from batches at W_t before the update. D0 is the full first batch noise, not multiplied by 1-beta; later D terms follow the source exponential averaging.","id":"topic:algorithm","source":["src_293fe077ed407a88295c42d8","src_c2006baa6ea30939f6b9a763","src_bc5f0f02387e648e447be892","src_769acb1dc63ec3a33d05a54d","src_555842d1134266274751bccc","src_60fadde6ad80613d32896e45","src_dc6478c950ca730ea0987c12","src_d02eadaa16a3572f