"],"comparison":"This unit has no public Convergence result or budget definition. Its intermediate statements are dependencies of the preserved source bounds and later point-output adapters; they do not replace direct final accuracy.","id":"topic:convergence","source":["src_293fe077ed407a88295c42d8","src_c2006baa6ea30939f6b9a763","src_bc5f0f02387e648e447be892","src_769acb1dc63ec3a33d05a54d","src_555842d1134266274751bccc","src_60fadde6ad80613d32896e45","src_dc6478c950ca730ea0987c12","src_d02eadaa16a3572f6afee7f9","src_4fa1940db34571e3a7f7fb2d","src_9cc08ee4796eaf54d485652b","src_4b2b38c364168ed4ffbf2578","src_11df7e512043b7f430109d54","src_6cd6624b5f4f11c2ab76bf05"],"verdict":"match"},{"candidate":["candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.batch_mean_sub/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.batch_noise/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.integral_norm_le_sqrt/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.momentum_noise/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.momentum_sqrt_le/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.noise_cross/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.noise_sq/preferred"],"comparison":"All gradient and polar expressions use the accepted Mat/nuclearNorm/spectralNorm/orthogonalize providers. Frobenius geometry is used for variance and rank conversion, while the final accuracy metric remains nuclear gradient norm.","id":"topic:representations","source":["src_293fe077ed407a88295c42d8","src_c2006baa6ea30939f6b9a763","src_bc5f0f02387e648e447be892","src_769acb1dc63ec3a33d05a54d","src_555842d1134266274751bccc","src_60fadde6ad80613d32896e45","src_dc6478c950ca730ea0987c12","src_d02eadaa16a3572f6afee7f9","src_4fa1940db34571e3a7f7fb2d","src_9cc08ee4796eaf54d485652b","src_4b2b38c364168ed4ffbf2578","src_11df7e512043b7f430109d54","src_6cd6624b5f4f11c2ab76bf05"],"verdict":"match"},{"candidate":["candidate/declaration_evide